French grammar processor

src/systems/grammar/frenchGrammar.js is translated from FrenchGrammarRules.cs,
the grammar processor the "DFU en francais" translation ships for Daggerfall
Unity. The translation's own text is not part of this port. The processor is
licensed as follows:

