src/systems/worldTooltips.js is translated from World Tooltips 1.1's own source
(Modded_HUDTooltipWindow.cs), the readied hands' frame in
src/combat/fpsSpellCasting.js from Readied Spellcasting Hands 1.3 (both by
jefetienne), and src/systems/unleveledLoot.js and
src/characters/meanerMonsters.js from Unleveled Loot 1.1.2 and Meaner Monsters
1.5.2 (Meaner Monsters' header: "Author: Hazelnut & Ralzar"). The mods' files
are no longer in this repository (OWN-WORK1, bible/01-Overview/Own-Work.md);
their licences travel with the code translated from them:

