----------------------------------------------------------------------

The Elder Scrolls II: Daggerfall is the property of Bethesda Softworks. This
port contains none of its data; the game's files are supplied by the player
at runtime and never enter this repository. The same holds for The Elder
Scrolls: Arena, also the property of Bethesda Softworks: the player's own
copy is read at runtime, and none of it is in this repository.
